{"q":"Why is Architectural Design important?","o":["It strongly influences performance, security, reliability, availability, maintainability, scalability, and the team's understanding of the system","It only determines the color of the interface","It eliminates all requirements","It replaces detailed design and testing completely"],"a":"It strongly influences performance, security, reliability, availability, maintainability, scalability, and the team's understanding of the system"},
