{"q":"What is an Architectural Decision?","o":["An important decision about system structure, component communication, technology, data location, security, or scalability","A decision about a variable name only","A customer-support ticket","A unit-test assertion"],"a":"An important decision about system structure, component communication, technology, data location, security, or scalability"},
