{"q":"Why is Software Testing important?","o":["It helps find defects, improve quality and reliability, verify requirements, reduce risk, and protect user experience","It guarantees that no defect can ever exist","It replaces software design","It is only needed after release"],"a":"It helps find defects, improve quality and reliability, verify requirements, reduce risk, and protect user experience"},
