{"q":"What is Acceptance Testing?","o":["Testing by customers or users to determine whether the system meets their needs and is ready for use","Testing only internal code paths","Testing compilation only","Testing a single loop"],"a":"Testing by customers or users to determine whether the system meets their needs and is ready for use"},
